sequenceDiagram
    participant TD as Trigger.dev
    participant SS as SyncService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GitHub as GitHub API
    participant LC as LeetCode API
    participant Email as Brevo

    TD->>SS: Fire sync job (every 6h)
    SS->>DB: Get all users with connected platforms
    DB-->>SS: Users list

    loop For each user
        SS->>DB: Get user's connected platforms
        DB-->>SS: UserPlatform records

        par Parallel platform sync
            SS->>GitHub: GET /user/commits (OAuth token)
            GitHub-->>SS: Commits data
        and
            SS->>LC: GraphQL query (username)
            LC-->>SS: Problems solved
        end

        SS->>SS: Normalize data to TrackerEntry format
        SS->>DB: Upsert TrackerEntries (batch)
        SS->>DB: Update User stats (streak, totals)
        SS->>DB: Create SyncLog record
        SS->>Email: Send sync summary (if enabled)
    end
